  "project_description": "Content Guide directly integrates external help and documentation written in GitHub Flavored Markdown into your entity forms (i.e. when creating nodes).\n\nThis enhances the author experience and guides your authors through content creation.\n \n The documentation can be attached to any field in your form (see Known issues for limitations). You can choose between an integration as tooltip or to display the documentation as additional description.\n\n \n \n \n \n \n Sponsors \n Development on Content Guide is sponsored by undpaul .",
